  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "RigidBodyBehaviour implements the logic to treat an entity as a dynamic rigid body within a PhysicsWorld. It manages physical properties like mass, damping, and gravity scaling, bridging the entity structure to the low-level physics backend. It provides methods for state manipulation, such as applying impulses, setting velocities, and teleporting, ensuring synchronous updates with the simulation world."
  },
